### Batch baseline — full refresh copies all provider rows and sets lastSync.
POST http://localhost:4107/pipeline/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Shipments","mode":"full","trigger":"manual"}

### Local replica after batch run
GET http://localhost:4107/odata/v4/example/Shipments?$orderby=modifiedAt desc&$top=5

### Capture watermark — note lastSync for comparison after event runs.
GET http://localhost:4107/pipeline/Pipelines?$filter=name eq 'Shipments'&$select=name,lastSync,status,mode

### Delta batch run — advances lastSync when rows changed on the remote.
POST http://localhost:4107/pipeline/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Shipments","mode":"delta","trigger":"manual"}

GET http://localhost:4107/pipeline/Pipelines?$filter=name eq 'Shipments'&$select=name,lastSync
